# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen upright (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2), a finger: the
# system's back gesture on the tape (sfdesk frame.mbt tape_back). The page brought over by a tap on what shows of it;
# swiped back from the left edge and called off (the tape with the finger, then back where it was); swiped again and
# gone through (on from there: the sidebar over); another chat chosen in the sidebar (the page over to show it);
# swiped back from the right edge (the sidebar over again, the tape the same way).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tapxy -24 420
wait 800
backswipe 240 700 off
wait 800
backswipe 240 700
wait 900
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 900
backswipe 240 700 right
wait 900
exit
